# Production-like local env (no secrets)

Copy values into `services/agent-service/.env` and web `.env.local`.
Never commit real secrets. Never put service secrets in `NEXT_PUBLIC_*`.

## Web (`apps/web/.env.local`)

```bash
AI_EXECUTION_MODE=agent-service
NEXT_PUBLIC_DATA_MODE=supabase
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR_PROJECT.supabase.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJ...
AGENT_SERVICE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000
```

## Agent service (`services/agent-service/.env`)

```bash
ENVIRONMENT=production-like
AI_EXECUTION_MODE=live
AGENT_RUNTIME_VERSION=langgraph
ALLOW_UNVERIFIED_JWT=false
QUEUE_INLINE=true
QUEUE_WORKER_ENABLED=false

SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR_PROJECT.supabase.co
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=eyJ...
SUPABASE_JWKS_URL=https://YOUR_PROJECT.supabase.co/auth/v1/.well-known/jwks.json
# or SUPABASE_JWT_SECRET=...
INTERNAL_SERVICE_TOKEN=long-random-string
SECRETS_ENCRYPTION_KEY=fernet-or-32+-char-secret
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://USER:PASS@HOST:5432/postgres

BUILDER_SANDBOX_ENABLED=true
SANDBOX_PROVIDER=e2b
E2B_API_KEY=e2b_...

OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
# and/or XAI_API_KEY=...

GOOGLE_OAUTH_CLIENT_ID=....apps.googleusercontent.com
GOOGLE_OAUTH_CLIENT_SECRET=GOCSPX-...
GOOGLE_OAUTH_REDIRECT_URI=http://localhost:3000/api/connections/google/callback

PIPEDREAM_CLIENT_ID=...
PIPEDREAM_CLIENT_SECRET=...
PIPEDREAM_PROJECT_ID=proj_...
PIPEDREAM_ENVIRONMENT=development
PIPEDREAM_ALLOWED_ORIGINS=["http://localhost:3000"]

WEB_SEARCH_API_KEY=tvly-...
CORS_ORIGINS=["http://localhost:3000"]
APP_ORIGIN=http://localhost:3000
```

When Pipedream Connect Production is available on your plan, switch:

```bash
PIPEDREAM_ENVIRONMENT=production
```
